    </sense>
    <field type="southern-kissi-sense"><form lang="en"><text>head; point, tip, edge, top</text></form></field>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 274 occurrences, first GEN.3.15; Keita 1979, p. 131: Bollen; Childs 2000, p. 21: bòlléŋ</text></form></note>
