    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 3 occurrences, first 1SA.19.10; Keita 1979, p. 114: Tyuköö; Childs 2000, p. 63: cùkàá</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="cumndo_187">
