      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="1.6.2 Parts of an animal"/>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="8.6.6 Edge"/>
    </sense>
    <field type="southern-kissi-sense"><form lang="en"><text>lip; beak, bill (also of a cap)</text></form></field>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 12 occurrences, first EXO.28.33; Keita 1979, p. 132: Työtyöèi; Childs 2000, p. 55: cɔ̀cùɛ̀í</text></form></note>
    <note><form lang="fr"><text>Dans la Bible, aussi le bord ou l'ourlet d'un vêtement (EXO.28.33).</text></form></note>
  </entry>
