    </sense>
    <field type="southern-kissi-sense"><form lang="en"><text>be stuck or trapped</text></form></field>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 3 occurrences, first EXO.27.3; Keita 1979, p. 114: Hawvo; Childs 2000, p. 119: hàùwó</text></form></note>
    <note><form lang="fr"><text>haw : presser (les raisins, GEN 40,11) ; hawnin : être pris (au piège, ISA 24,18).</text></form></note>
